cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it and the relevant paper listed in
  the references.
title: DT-GO
abstract: >-
  Code for Delay Tolerant Gossiped Optimization and the experiments presented
  in the associated papers on decentralized optimization in networks with
  arbitrary delays.
type: software
authors:
